<p style=3D"line-height:150%; font-size:22px; font-weight:normal"><strong>H=
ow this little-known company made the year=E2=80=99s bestselling toy</stron=
g>&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">If you had to guess what the most sought-afte=
r toy of the season was, you=E2=80=99d probably be wrong =E2=80=94 because,=
 odds are, you=E2=80=99ve never heard of it.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">Some industry experts hadn't even until last =
month, when it became a Black Friday hit, outselling Xbox, blowing up on Ti=
kTok Shop, and ranking No. 1 in Amazon=E2=80=99s Toys &amp; Games category,=
 <a href=3D"https://media.hubspot.com/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VWjfJ94mhvVwW=
3zR5m523MRYkW4nNzqf5HfdLXN8cZm5d2-ZW0W95jsWP6lZ3mPVXY2Py4CGmwbVZKnD83RM2B9W=
8Nh_102LlpmDW1z5yrP5zjFcxW5LDYv81-pm--W49WF0m58yvHcW1j6M_21Dp_2DVCYfvR8_7Rq=
PW70-v1d3kTY1KW7nGk689j9VtBW4ngr1-3BJhqpW4xVqwv38xGH8W4D667t49CnfLW55lL6K22=
M6Y9VP3yDd8S8r_qW2RfCPj2KM-XBW4DwVTp7PQWfvW4wDpjh3zFWXWW80vwdX2yc08TVBX53X2=
-ds_MW7vF7Zv9kw79yW31HBjr4QHfy6W3S1ffD5H_Sk2W5Cgphx8Dxyz9W6BhRWY8dBVHxMLz_9=
Scqc-HW2GVSzC7lHbgfW2sgxVy8hS37CMNFbqzzJ6YlN7QRJJPFZBSXf55qF6-04" style=3D"=
color:#192733" data-hs-link-id=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D"SI/nbCqy" target=
=3D"_blank">per</a> <span style=3D"font-style: italic;">The Wall Street Jou=
rnal.</span>&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">The toy in question? <a  href=3D"https://medi=
a.hubspot.com/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VWjfJ94mhvVwW3zR5m523MRYkW4nNzqf5HfdL=
XN8cZm3s2-ZW0W5BW0B06lZ3nPN46PxBwLmvgbW6xPZlB9js_svW37MWJq4b07VhW5bZ5bW1fDS=
scW7CRCY42nN58kVn4rk350wxprVcRT5563kNtrVVLfj15-QjN2W3hMH283vhvmSW7QhMRt1Z1W=
CNW3cMZ247bHN6KW1yvTyJ8hT4x5W3BMzYG2HF8H8N8cS2m0jRSQ0W2jgNBJ39TKW8W33GqK87_=
w9wqW5MDPdM5wgkBFW8LT-4Z4tSX1Xf1tC1N604" style=3D"color:#192733" data-hs-li=
nk-id=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D"Z1khUOZN" target=3D"_blank">Nex Playgroun=
d</a>, a $249 motion-based gaming console for kids that looks a bit like a =
Rubik=E2=80=99s cube with a camera and is on track to 4x its sales this yea=
r.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%; font-weight:normal"><strong>How it works</str=
ong></p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">The device is similar to a Nintendo Wii, but =
instead of controllers and buttons, it uses computer vision and AI to <a hr=
ef=3D"https://media.hubspot.com/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VWjfJ94mhvVwW3zR5m5=
23MRYkW4nNzqf5HfdLXN8cZm3s2-ZW0W5BW0B06lZ3llW8TPy2s4cJ1DZW16WxxM32KbBfW5NZB=
GW7Zn7NgW8RLvVF7g0wF6W5yg1mp3jF71xW3Km-QG5sCJP2N5rk42NStKLsW1LFq_75yqrr5W2g=
v6F43NRvy3W5_bdbd28KzStW5TDdsn2r7L9mW4mL51Y4jJGn7N6TLV5r4nMLlW1L3rBk37bjCxW=
57-GTz6kK_MfW2rYgLj6_JFs1N2FnSpH11Dg4W3k5GwP4k5m4Tf2bfxtY04" style=3D"color=
:#192733" data-hs-link-id=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D"jouTdopo" target=3D"_=
blank">track</a> users=E2=80=99 movements.&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">Besides a TV, WiFi, and floor space, it comes=
 with everything you need, including five free games.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">Why parents love it: It=E2=80=99s cheaper tha=
n other console systems, can accommodate up to four users at once, and unli=
ke regular video games and screen time, it keeps kids off their butts.&nbsp=
;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%"><strong>No overnight success</strong></p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">In 2017, Nex launched as a software company. =
In 2018, it debuted its first product: HomeCourt, a basketball shot-trackin=
g app powered by AI and computer vision.&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">But in 2020, recognizing the product=E2=80=99=
s limited market potential, it repurposed the same technology to introduce =
gamified workouts.&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">Those were a hit, so it made a separate app s=
olely for AR games. But after reviewing user engagement data, they eventual=
ly concluded that they needed to build their product for a bigger screen (i=
.e., TVs).</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">That=E2=80=99s when Nex made what one investo=
r called =E2=80=9Cthe mother of all pivots=E2=80=9D =E2=80=94 from software=
 to hardware =E2=80=94 because of which we=E2=80=99re now here talking abou=
t Playground, a success story.&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%"><strong>How it=E2=80=99s going</strong></p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">Before pivoting, Nex was making ~$3m and unpr=
ofitable. Now, thanks to Playground (which is currently sold out at most ma=
jor retailers that carry it) it=E2=80=99s on track to break even, with $150=
m+ in projected revenue for 2025 and 600k expected sales =E2=80=94 up from =
150k in 2024 and just 5k the year before that.&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">But will its success last?&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">Well, it did recently obtain licensing rights=
 to the hit children=E2=80=99s show =E2=80=9CBluey=E2=80=9D for a new game,=
 which, to use <em>WSJ=E2=80=99</em>s words, =E2=80=9Cis like a baseball te=
am signing Shohei Ohtani.=E2=80=9D</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">So we=E2=80=99re gonna bet yes.&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%"><br><span style=3D"font-size: 12px; color: #0=
00000;"> </span></p>
